02/24/2025 01:15;61536ea272f6970069fc1dbd;Good afternoon, Alanna, 



I hope you are doing well! I wanted to update you regarding the feedback we've received. I have communicated this feedback to the Food Resourcing Team, and Ronny has confirmed that the item has been removed from PartnerLink. The Operations Team is currently investigating the situation. 



Additionally, the team has my approval to issue credits for any partner reporting issues related to this item. 



Best regards,  

"D"{color:#172B4D}{color}  

