{"id": "11628", "key": "CAFBSS-206", "self": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/11628", "expand": "operations,versionedRepresentations,editmeta,changelog,renderedFields", "fields": {"votes": {"self": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/CAFBSS-206/votes", "votes": 0, "hasVoted": false}, "labels": [], "status": {"id": "10102", "name": "Closed", "self": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10102", "iconUrl": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/", "description": "(Migrated on 5 Apr 2025 15:04 UTC)", "statusCategory": {"id": 3, "key": "done", "name": "Done", "self": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3", "colorName": "green"}}, "comment": {"self": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/11628/comment", "total": 1, "startAt": 0, "comments": [{"id": "11130", "body": "02/04/2025 03:44;712020:b15fa988-bc60-49b4-aa6f-e30b7a3629c1;Good afternoon,

We hope this email finds you well. We are writing to inform you that your current produce limit is 6,250lbs, and you are currently exceeding that limit by 3,250lbs. In order to align your order with your limit, we will need to remove some items from your current produce order.

Below is the list of produce items in your order:

* 700759 Produce Pallet - 3 WAY - Onions, Potatoes, Apples - Quantity: 5

Please respond to this email with your selections of which produce items you would like us to remove. Kindly note that if we do not receive your response within 24 hours, our Customer Relations team will make adjustments to your order on your behalf.

Thank you for your attention to this matter!

Best regards,  
Customer Relations 
02/05/2025 11:33;712020:97a18e60-21c8-435c-89c3-2e1c58637a16;{color:#172B4D}

Good morning, 




I received your email noting that we are over the limit on our produce. Can we move the apples and keep the potatoes and onions? Will that put us below our limit? 




Thanks 
{color}{color:#172B4D}{color}
----
{color:#172B4D}{color} 









