02/05/2025 11:40;712020:b15fa988-bc60-49b4-aa6f-e30b7a3629c1;Good morning,

If we remove item 800111 Apples, Local Cardboard Bin 700# AVG from your order that will reduce your total pounds by 700lbs. You would still have 2,550lbs to go to reach your limit. Please let me know what other changes you would like made to your order.

Charity
02/05/2025 01:35;712020:97a18e60-21c8-435c-89c3-2e1c58637a16;{color:#172B4D}

On item #700759, can we reduce a portion of each of the onions, potatoes and apples to reduce to what we need leaving us some (if possible). 




The other option is to remove the apples and keep the onions and potatoes. The final suggestion would be to remove all apples and onions leaving us with just tthe potatoes only. 




Let me know which option works best. 


 Thanks 
{color}{color:#172B4D}{color}
----
