We hope this message finds you well. We are reaching out from the Customer Relations Team here at Capital Area Food Bank. 

We are contacting you to inform you that you have exceeded your produce limit by 550lbs. At this time, no action is needed and no removals are required; this message is simply to notify you of the overage.

Thank you,  
Customer Relations 
