Thank you for reaching out to Customer Relations! We hope you are staying warm and safe in this weather. We are also going to be closed tomorrow due to the snow. When would you like to reschedule your order? The earliest we can reschedule is Monday, January 13th. Please list a few options that will work with your agency and we will do our best to find a date and time that works with our avaiability. 

Thank you! 

"D"
