Thank you for reaching out to Customer Service. I have added one pallet of the Potato/Onion Mix Donated item to your order. Our Food Resourcing Team has informed me that this item is expected to remain in good condition until we return next week. If it meets our quality standards at that time, it will be included in your order. However, if it does not meet our quality criteria, we will remove it.

Please note that we typically do not add produce before the holiday break due to quality concerns, but we have made an exception in this case. We will reassess the quality upon our return.

Happy Holidays!

Best,  
"D"
12/24/2024 02:48;61536ea272f6970069fc1dbd;Good afternoon! I was able to add an additional 3-way produce pallet to your order, but we do not have any other produce items available to add. Happy Holidays! Thank you!
