12/20/2024 10:57;712020:b15fa988-bc60-49b4-aa6f-e30b7a3629c1;Good morning,

Thank you for contacting Customer Support. Please note that with the influx of orders for the holiday season, we do not have as much flexibility as we would like to reschedule orders. That said, the order you have scheduled for 12/24 is a Coastal Produce Box which is ordered by your Regional Coordinator. Please follow up with Augusta Fricke at [africke@capitalareafoodbank.org|mailto:africke@capitalareafoodbank.org] to see if there is anything within her capacity to reschedule your order. 

