Thank you for contacting customer support. At the moment, there is no way to merge orders and we do not advise partners to merge orders. Please be sure to edit your open orders so that way you can add more products to your one appointment. At this time, both orders are locked and unable to be edited. Please be sure to pick them up as scheduled.

