As I mentioned during our conversation earlier today, we are taking a closer look at this issue with the assistance of Chris's team and the IT team. For now, I will be closing this ticket since we still have another open ticket for you. We are working on determining if there is any chicken  that we can add back to your order and investigating what may have occurred here so we can prevent it in the future.

Best,  
"D"
