Good morning,

Thank you for contacting Customer Service. I will have our ERP Team investigate the issue with the dates. As we approach the holiday season, there can be changes to the schedule due to holiday closures, so I will ensure that the dates are accurate.

Regarding your order, I have added the two bins of cabbage and removed the turkey breasts as per your request.

Thank you,  
"D"
