11/25/2024 02:22;61536ea272f6970069fc1dbd;I spoke to our IT Team and this is what they said: 
_Please be aware that due to the introduction of produce limits in our system, partners will need to wait 30 minutes after placing an order before they can edit it. Additionally, after making any edits, partners must wait another 30 minutes before they can make further changes. Keep this in mind when making edits._

