erbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10067", "iconUrl": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium", "subtask": false, "avatarId": 10315, "entityId": "683abcaf-4b9b-46b1-969d-39a9d109d909", "description": "(Migrated on 5 Apr 2025 15:04 UTC)", "hierarchyLevel": 0}, "timespent": 0, "workratio": -1, "attachment": [], "components": [], "issuelinks": [], "lastViewed": null, "resolution": {"id": "10000", "name": "Done", "self": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/resolution/10000", "description": "Work has been completed on this issue."}, "description": "Hi Team, I hope you all are doing well. It seems some feedback from partners around the pallets being too high or double stacked have really increased in the past couple of weeks. I wanted to touch base with you all to see what may be causing this and if there are any possible solutions we can come up with to help partners while not impeding your processes! Thank you, Alanna ---- *From:* Than Tran *Sent:* Friday, November 15, 2024 1:14 PM *To:* Alanna King *Cc:* MaiTam Nguyen ; Tuong Phan *Subject:* BPSOS - Delivery Issue Hello Alanna, This is Than from BPSOS. I am writing this to let you know about an issue with our food delivery this morning 11/15. We ordered a total of 8 or 9 pallets of vegetables this morning. However, those pallets were stacked on top of each other as a pair when they were delivered. We asked the driver if he could bring the pallets down since they are very heavy (about 800 lbs each) and our office did not have any equipment to handle that. He said that there was nothing he could do because they were loaded into the truck like that. We did have this issue in the past and it took our staff (which comprised of many seniors) a tremendous amount of effort to handle it. We always appreciate CAFB for providing the food for free, but in the future, it would be great if you do not stack pallets on top of each other. If you have no choice but to do so, please let us know in advance. Best, *Than Tran* Program Coordinator BPSOS, Inc 6066 Leesburg Pike, Suite 100 Falls Church, VA 22041 Phone: (703) 538-2190 Fax: (703) 538-2191 If a federal employee or in the military, you can support our mission through CFC Charity No: 10038 CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE: This email and any files transmitted with it are confidential and intended solely for the use of the individual or entity to which they are addressed. If you are not the intended recipient, you may not review, copy or distribute this message. If you have received this email in error, please notify the sender immediately and delete the original message. Neither the sender nor the company for which he or she works accepts any liability for any damage caused by any virus transmitted by this email.", "environment": null, "fixVersions": [], "timeestimate": 0, "timetracking": {"timeSpent": "0m", "originalEstimate": "0m", "timeSpentSeconds": 0, "remainingEstimate": "0m", "originalEstimateSeconds": 0, "remainingEstimateSeconds": 0}, "resolutiondate": "2025-04-05T11:05:34.989-0400", "statusCategory": {"id": 3, "key": "done", "name": "Done", "self": "https://cafb-hungerbangers.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3", "colorName": "green"}, "aggregateprogress": {"total": 0, "progress": 0}, "customfield_10015": null, "customfield_10019": "0|i009in:", "customfield_10091": null, "customfield_10092": null, "customfield_10093": null, "customfield_10094": "01:36:00", "customfield_10095": "00:43:38.600000", "customfield_10096": ["delivery-confirmation-issues"], "customfield_10097": "2024-11-19", "customfield_10098": "Feedback - Concern / Negative -> Operations", "customfield_10099": "Email Request", "customfield_10100": "2024-11-19 12:24:00", "customfield_10101": ["delivery-issues"], "customfield_10102": "gnl iAannKa", "customfield_10103": "VA", "customfield_10104": "Partner Support / Customer Support", "customfield_10105": null, "customfield_10106": "Feedback Communicated", "customfield_10107": "01:54:00", "customfield_10108": "B. P. SOS", "customfield_10109": "English", "customfield_10110": null, "customfield_10111": "Email to Jira", "aggregatetimespent": 0, "timeoriginalestimate": 0, "aggregatetimeestimate": 0, "statuscategorychangedate": null, "aggregatetimeoriginalestimate": 0}}

