11/04/2024 09:37;61536ea272f6970069fc1dbd;Good morning,

Thank you for reaching out to Customer Service. I spoke with our Head of Procurement, who informed me that wheat flour and sugar are not typically included in our menu. We may receive these items as donations, but if that happens, we cannot predict the specific time or date they will arrive. Therefore, these items may not be featured on our regular menu. I apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.

Thank you,  
"D"
