Thank you for contacting Customer Relations. You are able to place orders that include TEFAP products and regular menu items together. However, please note that deliveries containing only TEFAP products are free of charge, while orders with a mix of TEFAP and regular menu items will incur a $75 delivery fee. Many of our partners do place orders with both types of food without any issues.

