09/12/2024 08:35;61536ea272f6970069fc1dbd;Good evening Grace,

Thank you so much for forwarding this information and for informing the agency about the best next steps to take when this happens. We work closely with Operations and are always happy to provide feedback, especially when we have item codes, sales orders, and photos to reference.

Thank you for capturing this!

