09/10/2024 10:17;641358c50152b5f4f9f0b9d3;There are no regulations limiting how much a partner can order, but I really do not think these quantities are reasonable. They have ordered 1,121 CASES of fruit (300 nectarines, 513 plums, 308 peaches), but they distribute to 280-350 households. This means that each household would receive at least 3 CASES of fruit. Thatâ€™s in addition to the CAFB produce that theyâ€™ve also ordered. This is really excessive. 
09/10/2024 10:40;641358c50152b5f4f9f0b9d3;There are no regulations on how much a TEFAP partner can distribute.{color:#172B4D}{color}  



