I called the partner and she was surprised at the total weight of the order. She mentioned that she needed to do some calculations and was busy at the time. I offered to edit the order for her but she preferred to edit it at her own convenience. I am happy to keep this ticket open and will send her an email on Thursday to follow up if the numbers haven't changed.

