09/10/2024 10:34;61536ea272f6970069fc1dbd;Good morning Sally,

We apologize for the incident regarding the bugs on the food items. I have alerted our Operations Team so we can check the rest of the inventory of this item. I'm sorry that your volunteers had to clean the bugs off the food items. Can you please let me know how many cases you were unable to utilize for your distribution? I understand that you mentioned bags, but if you could provide the number of cases, that would be helpful so I can process a return for you.

Thank you,

"D"
09/10/2024 03:02;qm:65d20c5a-0c84-458e-8ce1-adb90d07460f:ed7401ad-7f8a-4c1f-af90-23a71c8cdab4;"D",  



I think each case has 10 bags in it so the volunteers had to throw out 2 cases. 



Thank you,  


 Sally
