08/15/2024 11:06;712020:38c82492-84fe-40dc-8901-61d65a68f6d3;Good morning and thank you for contacting customer support. I have reached out to our Head of Food Procurement about your inquiries and concerns. He has advised me that 8oz Milk is 9/6 but rush ship was requested. Applesauce cups 300081 will be in DC sometime next week. We do not currently carry cereal bowls or bottled water, or 2oz tuna.  He will do some research and let us know what he finds. Soups and apple juices are still TBD as well as we are working on stocking our new warehouse and are having shipments received at both locations. Granola bars are expected tomorrow in DC and should be on the menu tomorrow or early next week.  We appreciate your feedback and are sending these concerns up the proper channels to create resolutions

CiArra
08/15/2024 12:33;qm:65d20c5a-0c84-458e-8ce1-adb90d07460f:63c7fe80-ba74-445b-827f-3853911ab41d;{color:#172B4D}Thanks for getting back to me. Your info has given a better timeline when I can expect to place a delivery order ( looking more like early September). Thanks again.{color}{color:#172B4D}{color}  

{color:#172B4D} Laurese Dancy{color}{color:#172B4D}{color}  

{color:#172B4D} Ps: keep me posted if things change.{color} 
