07/18/2024 02:09;712020:44f76476-84e5-4a70-9ec9-f416f5d62412;{color:#172B4D}If under the present circumstances, food purchased from CAFB can only be delivered to and stored at the Kennedy location, I would like to take the required steps to add our Bailey's location. Additionally for accounting purposes, it is much better for us to separate the purchases.{color}{color:#172B4D}{color}  

{color:#172B4D} I am happy to arrange the Bailey's site visit.{color} 
----

